# -- Test bundles that link SsaCore statically (audit c) -----------------------
# Each bundle defines _Kotlin_getSourceInfo_core_symbolication, Kotlin 2.0.21's
# stdlib symbolicator (its libstdlib-cache.a.o entry was removed on 2026-11-28),
# and no longer contains _platform_posix_dlsym_wrapper50 (the linker dropped it).
# The other static inputs on each link line import no _dlsym: the test target's
# own object (CoreCryptoTests.o, PdfSpikeTests.o), CoreCrypto.o or SsaPdf.o (audit b), and the clang profile runtime that
# -profile-generate (code coverage) adds, libclang_rt.profile_iossim.a.
